{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_250_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_250","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_250_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_250","textTraditional":"二十二年夏四月，邾隱公自齊奔越，曰：「吳為無道，執父立子。」越人歸之，大子革奔越。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_250_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_250","textTraditional":"冬十一月丁卯，越滅吳，請使吳王居甬東，辭曰：「孤老矣，焉能事君？」乃縊。越人以歸。","sentenceOrder":3}],"overrides":{}}